#. module: it_hardware
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:it_hardware.product_template_21
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>An affordable, entry-level workstation and "
"light gaming PC designed for daily productivity, esports titles, and smooth "
"1080p media performance.</i></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>ຄອມພິວເຕີເຮັດວຽກລະດັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລາຄາປະຢັດ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງຫຼິ້ນເກມທົ່ວໄ"
"ປ ທີ່ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກປະຈຳວັນ, ເກມ esports, ແລະ ການສະແດງຜົນສື່ 1080p ທີ່ລື່ນໄຫຼ.</i>"
"</span>"

#. module: it_hardware
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:it_hardware.product_template_20
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>Crystal-clear spatial audio, deep active noise "
"isolation, and lag-free wireless performance for total gaming immersion.</"
"i></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>ລະບົບສຽງມິຕິຄົມຊັດ, ການຕັດສຽງລົບກວນແບບ Active ຂັ້ນສູງ, ແລ"
"ະ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄຮ້ສາຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີສະດຸດ ເພື່ອຄວາມສົມຈິງໃນການຫຼິ້ນເກມຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບ.</i></span>"

#. module: it_hardware
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:it_hardware.product_template_23
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>Designed for heavy multi-threading, high-fps "
"gaming, and demanding creative workloads without bottlenecks.</i></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບວຽກປະມວນຜົນຫຼາຍໜ້າວຽກພ້ອມກັນແບບໜັກໜ່ວງ, ກາ"
"ນຫຼິ້ນເກມ FPS ສູງ, ແລະ ວຽກສ້າງສັນລະດັບສູງ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີບັນຫາຄໍຂວດ.</i></span>"

#. module: it_hardware
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:it_hardware.product_template_22
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>Engineered for fast multitasking and reliable "
"1080p esports gaming, combining 6-core processing power with dual-channel "
"memory.</i></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອການເຮັດວຽກຫຼາຍໜ້າວຽກພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ ແລ"
"ະ ການຫຼິ້ນເກມ esports 1080p ທີ່ໝັ້ນຄົງ, ຜະສົມຜະສານພະລັງປະມວນຜົນ 6-core ກັບໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳແບບສອງ"
"ຊ່ອງ (Dual-channel).</i></span>"

#. module: it_hardware
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:it_hardware.product_template_18
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>Engineered with extreme power delivery and "
"heavy thermal armor to maximize stable overclocking for next-gen CPUs and "
"high-frequency DDR5 memory.</i></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>ອອກແບບດ້ວຍລະບົບຈ່າຍໄຟຂັ້ນສູງ ແລະ ເກາະລະບາຍຄວາມຮ້ອນຂະໜາ"
"ດໃຫຍ່ ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບການໂອເວີຄລັອກ (overclocking) ທີ່ສະຖຽນສຳລັບຊີພີຢູຮຸ່ນໃໝ່ ແລະ ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ DDR5 "
"ຄວາມຖີ່ສູງ.</i></span>"

#. module: it_hardware
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:it_hardware.product_template_17
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>Hand-screened ICs optimized for high-bandwidth "
"stability, low latency, and maximum overclocking headroom.</i></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>ຊິບ IC ທີ່ຜ່ານການຄັດເລືອກຢ່າງລະອຽດ ເພື່ອຄວາມສະຖຽນຂອງແບນວິ"
"ດສູງ, ຄວາມໜ່ວງຕ່ຳ, ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ສຳລັບການໂອເວີຄລັອກໄດ້ສູງສຸດ.</i></span>"

#. module: it_hardware
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:it_hardware.product_template_16
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>Precision-binned for maximum thermal "
"efficiency and unmatched high-FPS gaming performance.</i></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>ຜ່ານການຄັດເກຣດຢ່າງແມ່ນຢຳ ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບຄວາມຮ້ອນສູງສຸດ ແລ"
"ະ ພະລັງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ high-FPS ທີ່ເໜືອກວ່າໃຜ.</i></span>"

#. module: it_hardware
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:it_hardware.product_template_24
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>The apex of raw compute capacity — engineered "
"for heavy 3D rendering, deep learning workloads, multi-stream encoding, and "
"uncompromised gaming.</i></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>ຈຸດສູງສຸດຂອງພະລັງການປະມວນຜົນ — ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບການເຣັນເດີ "
"3D ຢ່າງໜັກໜ່ວງ, ວຽກ deep learning, ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຫຼາຍສະຕຣີມ, ແລະ ການຫຼິ້ນເກມແບບເຕັມປະສິດທິພາ"
"ບ.</i></span>"

#. module: it_hardware
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:it_hardware.product_template_19
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>Ultra-fast response, hyper-vivid OLED color "
"accuracy, and seamless panoramic immersion engineered for competitive and "
"cinematic gaming.</i></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>ການຕອບສະໜອງທີ່ວ່ອງໄວພິເສດ, ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງສີສັນ OLED ທີ່ສົດ"
"ໃສ, ແລະ ມຸມມອງພາໂນຣາມາແບບໄຮ້ຮອຍຕໍ່ ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບການແຂ່ງຂັນເກມ ແລະ ການຮັບຊົມທີ່ສົມຈິງ.</i>"
"</span>"

#. module: it_hardware
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:it_hardware.product_template_8
msgid ""
"<span class=\"text-white\"><i>Zero smoothing, maximum accuracy, and instant "
